      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Darragh O Se are delighted to bring to the market 230 St Brendans Park Tralee Co Kerry. This property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and would make an ideal family home, first-time purchase or investment property. The property provides comfortable living space with three bedrooms, making it a versatile home for a variety of buyers.The ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living/dining area and kitchen, while upstairs there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\nThe property also benefits from private outdoor space to the rear, providing an ideal area for relaxing, entertaining or family use. There is excellent potential for the new owner to modernise and personalise the property to their own taste.\r\nSt Brendan’s Park is a well-established residential location within easy reach of Tralee town centre and a wide range of local amenities, including schools, shops, sporting facilities, restaurants and public transport links. The property is also conveniently located for access to the N21 and surrounding areas. Viewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
